   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves along the curve \\( x^{2} - x y + 2 y^{2} = 23 \\). At the instant when the particle is at the point \\( (3, -2) \\), its x-coordinate is changing at the rate \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = -4 \\). Find \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\) at that instant.",
      "command_verb": "find"
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
